.TH FOLIO-WRITER 1 "October 2026" "Folio Page 2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
folio-page, folio \- ribbon word processor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B folio-page
[\fIFILE\fR...]
.br
.B folio-page
\-\-reset-settings | \-\-make-default | \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a new document, or the given files, in Folio Page. Settings, recent
files, the Normal template and AutoRecover files live in
\fI~/.config/folio-page\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-reset-settings
Forget settings and the customised Normal template.
.TP
.B \-\-make-default
Make Folio Page the default application for .docx, .doc, .dotx and .rtf files.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
/usr/share/doc/folio-page/SHORTCUTS.txt
Keyboard shortcut reference (also under Help in the application).
